mermaid_flowchart:
flowchart LR
    A[LLM Generated Visual Works] --> B[Automated Generation/Collection]
    B --> C(Raw Multimodal Artifacts)
    C --> D{{Automated Multimodal Evaluation}}
    D --> E{Initial Filtering/Scoring}
    E -->|Pass| F[Selected Artifacts]
    E -->|Fail| Z[Discard]
    F --> G{{MLLM-as-Judge}}
    G --> H{MLLM-based Scoring/Filtering}
    H -->|Pass| I[Candidate Artifacts]
    H -->|Fail| Z
    I --> J{{Human Expert Validation}}
    J --> K{Quality Check & Refinement}
    K -->|Approved| L(ArtifactsBench Dataset)
    K -->|Rejected| Z
    L --> M[Model Evaluation using ArtifactsBench]
    M --> N[Benchmark Results]
